Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.12,0:02:55.86,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NI can't see him at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.11,0:03:02.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NStamp!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.91,0:03:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And spear!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.51,0:03:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NMissile!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.28,0:03:20.51,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NImpossible.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.42,0:03:27.40,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NNo, it has to be.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.40,0:03:31.44,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,The truth is I'm glad\NI met you guys when I did.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.44,0:03:33.34,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NHe's using the Shave technique.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.99,0:03:38.30,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Only CP9 should know the Six Powers,\Nbut he's clearly mastered it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.21,0:03:41.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NAir Door!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.74,0:03:46.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.88,0:03:48.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He disappeared.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.19,0:03:50.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NThis is unheard of.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.50,0:03:53.27,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,A pirate commanding\None of our techniques?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.69,0:03:55.99,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a sick joke.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.99,0:04:00.23,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he was\Ncapable of this all along!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.86,0:04:04.20,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.20,0:04:07.93,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,No one can match the speed\Nof a true Six Powers master!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.93,0:04:10.34,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't lose to him!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.30,0:04:14.91,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,If I turn his body parts\Ninto doors like before,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.91,0:04:17.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,that should stop him\Ndead in his tracks.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.18,0:04:22.29,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,After that, all I have\Nto do is finish him off.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.29,0:04:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NDoor-Door!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.36,0:05:13.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure are tough, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.23,0:05:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right then.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.34,0:05:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was gonna save it, but\NI have an even better trick.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.31,0:05:20.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't blink.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.38,0:05:25.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I call this...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.87,0:05:39.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NMan, I'm beat.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.51,0:05:42.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess my body can't\Nkeep this up for long.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.88,0:05:47.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't care\Nabout my body right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.38,0:05:51.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need to move ahead.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.89,0:05:59.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NDamn it! What's going on here?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.93,0:06:02.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NQuick! Fire the cannons, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.53,0:06:04.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before they step on us!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.09,0:06:06.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CASHY]\NYeah, nice try!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.62,0:06:08.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But those peashooters\Naren't enough to stop me!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.94,0:06:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OIMO]\NYou can run or you can fight, little men,\Nbut we're comin' through either way!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.17,0:06:18.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NI see it and I still can't believe it!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.33,0:06:22.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you said to those guys,\Nbut it must've been something else!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.58,0:06:24.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NWe warriors understand each other!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.61,0:06:27.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The time has come, brothers!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.15,0:06:29.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The courthouse is\Nlooming on the horizon.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.82,0:06:31.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onward!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.08,0:06:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What're you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.14,0:06:36.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and go inside already!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.42,0:06:38.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pirates are in the\Ncourthouse, aren't they?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.46,0:06:40.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NYeah, but the problem\Nis there's a big frog
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.33,0:06:42.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at the door and he's\Nnot letting anyone in!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.43,0:06:44.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NA frog?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.66,0:06:48.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NKeep fighting, Yokozuna!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.10,0:06:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't give 'em an inch!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.88,0:06:52.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't stop until the\Ndrawbridge comes down!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.34,0:06:56.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If those guys break our line of defense,\Nthousands of 'em could pour in here!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.28,0:06:58.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[YOKOZUNA]\NGero!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.99,0:07:05.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIWI]\NOnly one of us needs to get through!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.01,0:07:09.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if everyone else falls, as long\Nas someone pulls that lever, we've won!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.65,0:07:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NYou okay, Sis?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.43,0:07:23.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MOZU]\NDon't worry about me!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.40,0:07:25.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All that matters is\Nbringing down that bridge
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.24,0:07:28.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and making sure the Straw Hats\Nget to the Tower of Law!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.14,0:07:28.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NHold it!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.84,0:07:30.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.14,0:07:31.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CENTER BASKERVILLE]\NOh yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.14,0:07:33.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Try and stop me!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.50,0:07:39.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are those pirates plotting?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.02,0:07:43.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why's it so important\Nfor them to go upstairs, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.74,0:07:47.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't get an answer outta me!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.48,0:07:48.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LEFT BASKERVILLE]\NWe'll see about that!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.88,0:07:52.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'll tell you one thing... you're\Ngonna pay if you hurt our big bro!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.45,0:07:56.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NAfter them!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.63,0:07:58.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring those pirates down!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.89,0:08:02.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}How many of these stupid guards are we\Ngonna have to beat before they catch a hint?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.76,0:08:05.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NThere they are!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.43,0:08:06.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.43,0:08:08.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NMove!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.43,0:08:12.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHey, if you have to throw them,\Nat least don't throw them at me!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.14,0:08:15.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GUILTY JURY]\NGuilty! Guilty!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.80,0:08:17.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guilty! Guilty! Guilty!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.11,0:08:18.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guilty! Guilty!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.27,0:08:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guilty! Guilty! Guilty!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.31,0:08:20.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would you guys shut up?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.28,0:08:21.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to think here.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.94,0:08:24.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Must've taken a wrong turn somewhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.60,0:08:35.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NYou want us to take\NFranky and Nico Robin
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.53,0:08:37.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to the Gates of Justice now?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.14,0:08:37.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NYes!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.84,0:08:38.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.54,0:08:39.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.40,0:08:40.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NBut we're way ahead of schedule.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.64,0:08:42.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The escort ship isn't even ready yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.57,0:08:43.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.74,0:08:46.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can just wait for it on\Nthe other side of the gates!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.58,0:08:47.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we get rid of those two,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.45,0:08:52.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no point in\Nrisking another battle
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.15,0:08:55.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with those monsters when we have\Nthe power to end this right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.32,0:08:59.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And while you're at it, gather\Nall the members of CP9, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.29,0:09:00.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIALS]\NSir!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.36,0:09:05.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.30,0:09:09.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems as if your one-way trip to hell\Nwill be departing ahead of schedule.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.66,0:09:14.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll have all the time in\Nthe world to deal with your friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.41,0:09:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NThose pirates sure know how to\Nbring the party, don't they?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.05,0:09:25.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know if they have common sense,\Nbut they sure as heck have guts!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.88,0:09:27.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NJust you wait and watch, Chimney.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.82,0:09:31.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the end, whether they live\Nor die, that Straw Hat boy
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.29,0:09:35.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and all of his little friends are gonna\Nshake things up the whole world over.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.76,0:09:39.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In hundreds of years, nobody's\Npulled a stunt like this one!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.28,0:09:41.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mark my words.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.29,0:09:44.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When this battle is over, every\Nman, woman, and child
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.99,0:09:48.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is gonna know the\Nname of Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.14,0:10:00.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NRobin!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.96,0:10:02.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! He made it!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.13,0:10:05.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.30,0:10:09.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm here to save you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.40,0:10:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\N{\q2}Chief Spandam, sir, there's a man in a straw\Nhat standing on the courthouse rooftop
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.27,0:10:16.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who's shouting things at Nico Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.09,0:10:19.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to confirm his identity\Nup close, but I assume it must be Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.80,0:10:20.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the rooftop?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.78,0:10:24.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could that happen when I saw\NBlueno up there just a second ago?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.25,0:10:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought he was\Nkeeping watch! That idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.81,0:10:30.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.86,0:10:38.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess I've been running\Naround a lot, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.83,0:10:41.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, time for a snack!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.30,0:10:43.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good thing I came prepared!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.39,0:10:48.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meat time!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.18,0:10:54.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew putting these in my\Npockets was a good idea!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.79,0:10:57.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just wish I had more pockets!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.93,0:11:04.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's him, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.22,0:11:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.89,0:11:08.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But what the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.33,0:11:11.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If Blueno was up there,\Nhe should have...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.13,0:11:15.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.60,0:11:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, he couldn't have...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.40,0:11:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blueno's a member of CP-9!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.40,0:11:21.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A Six Powers master!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.94,0:11:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With Devil Fruit powers, no less!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.87,0:11:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His power level is superhuman!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAll right! Ready for round 2!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.45,0:11:34.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NHow could that scrawny\Nbrat ever defeat him?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.80,0:11:42.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ch-chief Spandam, sir,\Nhow should we proceed?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.37,0:11:45.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci! Where is he?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.24,0:11:47.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody call him, now!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.98,0:11:49.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the rest of CP9, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.81,0:11:50.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.88,0:11:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't be satisfied until\Nthey wipe out Straw Hat
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.15,0:11:55.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and everyone in his wretched crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.40,0:11:57.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NAnd while you're at it,\Ntell Baskerville that
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.20,0:12:00.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if he lets the Straw Hats\Nlower that bridge,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.04,0:12:02.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going to send all\Nthree of his heads rolling!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.44,0:12:04.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL & MARINE]\NYes sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.75,0:12:08.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NHey.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.45,0:12:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get that chin up, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.62,0:12:15.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know, most people wouldn't\Ncome here to save their friends.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.87,0:12:18.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell, most people couldn't\Neven make it here at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.97,0:12:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong, I know\Nthe only reason you agreed
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.24,0:12:26.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to the Government's terms was so you could\Nprotect 'em, but you saw what happened.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.55,0:12:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They don't give a damn about keeping\Ntheir word to you or anyone else.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.58,0:12:32.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The deal is shot.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.46,0:12:35.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if you keep your end of the bargain,\Nit's not gonna help anyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.66,0:12:39.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only thing left is to wait for your\Ncrew to break you outta this dump.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.63,0:12:41.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doesn't sound so bad to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.96,0:12:46.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet, here you are,\Nlooking as miserable as ever.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.37,0:12:50.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I get the feeling you're running from\Nsomething even your friends don't know about.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.44,0:12:56.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry about the\NStraw Hats dying in this place,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.41,0:13:00.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}but if you can't look 'em in the eye,\Nin the end, they won't be able to save you.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.55,0:13:04.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey! Is anybody there?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.62,0:13:11.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, whether you like it or not,\NI'm gonna make you face him.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.27,0:13:16.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NListen up, all of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.21,0:13:19.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're putting Nico Robin out of\NStraw Hat's reach immediately!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.55,0:13:21.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come with me to the Gates of Justice.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.45,0:13:22.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring the prisoners!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.92,0:13:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NBu...but Chief!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.58,0:13:26.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No buts, just do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.92,0:13:27.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NWell... uh.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.75,0:13:30.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's one giant butt\Nthat's a big problem!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.79,0:13:32.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.49,0:13:35.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.15,0:13:36.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NOh, hey Spanda.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.81,0:13:39.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like you said, I'm pretty much screwed,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.05,0:13:41.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I figured I might as\Nwell blow myself up, y'know.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.58,0:13:42.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.59,0:13:46.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That way, at least I get to take\Nyour sorry ass with me when I go.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.22,0:13:48.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You fool! Wait a minute, will you?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.79,0:13:52.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When my butt goes off, the explosion's\Ngonna be at least a mile wide.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.75,0:13:56.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not much point in running,\Nbut you might as well try.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.56,0:14:00.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on in\Nyour pants, but please make it stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.27,0:14:05.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three... two... Damn it,\NI can't die at a time like this!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.50,0:14:07.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.28,0:14:10.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.36,0:14:13.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time to go, Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.07,0:14:18.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coup de Boo!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.91,0:14:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.58,0:14:26.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The chains are broken, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.68,0:14:29.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're falling!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.82,0:14:33.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.42,0:14:46.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.29,0:14:50.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good thing that fence was\Nthere to catch us, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.49,0:14:52.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.19,0:14:54.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You didn't get hurt, did you?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.33,0:14:59.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I had another bottle of cola,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.73,0:15:03.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could get us to the other\Nside with a Coup de Vent.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.17,0:15:05.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.24,0:15:06.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's over there.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.84,0:15:10.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance,\Nbetter give him your answer.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.48,0:15:11.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NHe tricked us!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.48,0:15:12.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NChief!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.35,0:15:16.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky and Nico Robin broke the\Nchains and went out on the balcony!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.45,0:15:18.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NThen what are you waiting for, stupid?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.22,0:15:19.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Capture them already!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.46,0:15:22.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you let them get away, I'll\Nsend you all to the gallows!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.29,0:15:24.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.54,0:15:33.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey, Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.87,0:15:35.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're still there!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.30,0:15:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me yelling?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.52,0:15:39.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.46,0:15:40.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NDon't let them get away!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.63,0:15:42.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grab them before they run!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.09,0:15:44.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't have time\Nfor you thugs right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.36,0:15:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weapons Left!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.40,0:15:51.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess that mean's Franky's there, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.44,0:15:54.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Kay! I'll be right over!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.01,0:15:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a little far, but I can make it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.90,0:16:07.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NStop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.58,0:16:16.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NHow many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.13,0:16:17.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not coming back!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.23,0:16:19.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not part of your crew anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.30,0:16:20.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just go away!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.98,0:16:22.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see\Nyour face ever again!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.89,0:16:23.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.95,0:16:26.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did you come to\Nsave me in the first place?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.47,0:16:29.07,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Why can't you just let me go?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.35,0:16:31.72,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I never asked for this!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.72,0:16:33.79,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,You've gone too far!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.79,0:16:35.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For the last time.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.55,0:16:37.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't want you here!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.35,0:16:49.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me? I just want to die!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.41,0:16:57.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NNow this is\Nentertainment! What a twist!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.74,0:16:59.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you trying to pull?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.48,0:17:03.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your friends put their lives on\Nthe line to come here, and you...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.68,0:17:05.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NThey decided to do that on their own.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.73,0:17:06.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.70,0:17:08.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares if...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.35,0:17:14.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NYou're in the way.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.62,0:17:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[JABURA]\NWhat's wrong, Kaku?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.56,0:17:19.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Venting your anger?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.12,0:17:21.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause your Devil Fruit\Npowers are so lame?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.76,0:17:22.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NOh, shut up already!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.79,0:17:25.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I like my powers just fine!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.63,0:17:29.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KALIFA]\NOh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.50,0:17:32.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All this ruckus for one little pirate?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.20,0:17:33.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KUMADORI]\NYoyoi!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.37,0:17:39.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alone though he may be,\Nhis perseverance is certainly admirable!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.71,0:17:43.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[JABURA]\NI'll be damned.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.65,0:17:47.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he beat Blueno\Nafter all! What a fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.62,0:17:52.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NBeing a barkeep for five years probably\Ndidn't do his fighting skills any favors.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.29,0:17:55.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NSo it would appear,\Nbut it's still a surprise.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.13,0:17:58.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FUKURO]\NEither way, he lost! Chapapa!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.68,0:18:03.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you could all make it, CP9!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.58,0:18:05.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And just in time, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.55,0:18:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems the Straw Hats\Nare having a little tiff!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.38,0:18:10.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's quite amusing!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.49,0:18:13.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't miss it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.66,0:18:27.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NGood work out there,\NYokozuna! Keep it up!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.23,0:18:28.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[YOKOZUNA]\NGero!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.24,0:18:37.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GUILTY JUROR]\NGuilty.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.07,0:18:38.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GUILTY JUROR]\NGuilty.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.31,0:18:40.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NYes!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.11,0:18:41.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the Guilty Jury!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.61,0:18:42.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GUILTY JUROR]\NStep aside.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.58,0:18:45.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time for that frog\Nto hear its verdict.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.38,0:18:49.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[YOKOZUNA]\NGero?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.59,0:18:55.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GUILTY JUROR]\NGuilty!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.06,0:18:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GUILTY JUROR]\NGuilty!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.12,0:19:14.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NUgh! Just what we need, more weirdos!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.22,0:19:16.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GUILTY JUROR]\NGuilty! Guilty!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.91,0:19:20.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLet's get 'em, Chopper...wait,\NI mean, go get 'em, Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.38,0:19:22.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWhat? Me? Alone?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.95,0:19:24.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NI gotta admit.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.18,0:19:27.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never thought there'd be an\Nactual judge on this island.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.78,0:19:33.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard that the people who get taken\Nhere are already considered guilty,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.07,0:19:38.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}so the Marines just lead the poor saps\Nthrough an empty court without even stopping.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.54,0:19:40.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LEFT BASKERVILLE]\NI'm afraid you're mistaken, pirate.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.81,0:19:43.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, this\Ncourthouse carries the integrity
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.51,0:19:45.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of the greatest authority in the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.71,0:19:48.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even scum like you are\Ngiven a trial by jury.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.68,0:19:49.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CENTER BASKERVILLE]\NHowever.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.65,0:19:53.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The jury here consists\Nentirely of former pirates
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.02,0:19:56.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who have been condemned to death\Nrow in this very courtroom.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.00,0:19:59.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Therefore, their only desire is\Nto drag others down with them.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.28,0:20:06.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This place really is the gate\Nto the underworld, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.85,0:20:09.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RIGHT BASKERVILLE]\NThus, in all the trials\Ncarried out on this island.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.55,0:20:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not once.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.56,0:20:14.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Has any criminal\Nbeen found 'not guilty'!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.60,0:20:15.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NKiwi!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.30,0:20:16.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.03,0:20:22.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GUILTY JUROR]\NGuilty!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.97,0:20:25.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guilty!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.94,0:20:27.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NDamn, they're too strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.67,0:20:29.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MOZU]\NWe can't give up now!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.98,0:20:33.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we don't bring down that\Ndrawbridge, it's all over!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.02,0:20:35.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remember, Straw Hat is the one\Nwho's gonna rescue our Bro.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.96,0:20:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we can't help him with this,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.19,0:20:40.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then we have no right to call\Nourselves the Franky Family!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.46,0:20:42.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[YOKOZUNA]\NGero!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.50,0:20:46.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NYokozuna!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.51,0:20:51.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NYou took all of those blows for\Nus and never budged an inch!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.41,0:20:54.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll avenge you!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.35,0:20:58.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NDon't bother! We've\Nstill got 6,000 marines!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.43,0:20:59.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NNow!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.13,0:21:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's storm the courthouse, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.07,0:21:03.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crush those pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.78,0:21:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.73,0:21:20.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NWhat's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.76,0:21:22.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are the giants here?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.90,0:21:26.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NIt's the frog!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.67,0:21:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NWhat's the situation here?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.61,0:21:30.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NWait. I know you!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.94,0:21:32.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're with the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.61,0:21:34.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with those giants?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.68,0:21:38.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OIMO]\NCan't believe he held off all\Nthose marines on his own!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.78,0:21:42.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CASHY]\NYeah, he's one hell of a frog!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.80,0:21:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWhere did they run off to?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.40,0:21:55.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They must've gotten lost again.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.59,0:21:58.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this crap.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.56,0:22:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, as long as I go up,\Neverything should work out fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.14,0:22:06.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tatsu maki!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.86,0:22:14.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHuh? What?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.19,0:22:18.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWe better keep moving!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.87,0:22:33.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NYou pirates really are in a\Nleague of your own, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.86,0:22:36.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're even strong enough\Nto order giants around!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.31,0:22:38.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's almost scary, really.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.04,0:22:42.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NHm? Well... uh... [FAMILY MAN]\NOh, by the way, your other crewmates
Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.41,0:22:44.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are headed to the roof right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.28,0:22:45.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NThe roof?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.12,0:22:46.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should go meet them!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.81,0:22:48.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave that one to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.18,0:22:50.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll get you there in a flash.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.51,0:22:51.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.94,0:22:59.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna die?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.04,0:23:00.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.71,0:23:05.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[JABURA]\NWait a second, Chief.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.97,0:23:07.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are we listening to this crap
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.60,0:23:10.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when we could just go over\Nand pound that guy's face in?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.14,0:23:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NPatience, patience!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.21,0:23:13.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we have a captain
Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.28,0:23:15.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who risked his life to\Nsave one of his crewmates
Dialogue: 50,0:23:15.58,0:23:19.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,only to have his precious hopes\Ndashed at the very last second.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.38,0:23:21.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How tragic!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.35,0:23:23.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet I can't tear my eyes away!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.29,0:23:24.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too amusing!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.76,0:23:25.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NRobin!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.97,0:23:29.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.37,0:23:32.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, could he be more pathetic?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.01,0:23:34.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I gotta see the look on his face!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.68,0:23:38.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that sounds dumb to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.38,0:23:42.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's picking his nose?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.19,0:23:46.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NListen, that won't work.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.35,0:23:48.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're already here,\Nand it was a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:00.56,0:24:02.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we're gonna go ahead and save you.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.03,0:24:03.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLanded.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:05.72,0:24:08.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And if you still wanna die\Nafter we're all back together.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.71,0:24:13.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that's your choice.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.50,0:24:17.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NOw, ow ow.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.10,0:24:19.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLooks like you landed on\Nyour head...are you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.47,0:24:20.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NYeah, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.06,0:24:24.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck happened back there?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.00,0:24:27.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI think I might have\Nan idea of who to blame.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.16,0:24:37.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.00,0:24:39.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was a lot easier than\Ndealing with those stupid stairs.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.73,0:24:40.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThere he is!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.77,0:24:42.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew it was you!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.03,0:24:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're lucky we got\Nout of the way in time!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.87,0:24:46.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that thing had hit us\Nhead-on, we'd be dead right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.31,0:24:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NOh, you're here, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.05,0:24:53.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NDash!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.03,0:24:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boar Stew Shoot!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:57.19,0:24:59.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NI'm the first one here, no doubt.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.11,0:25:01.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've left Robin waiting long enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.04,0:25:04.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time for her prince to...Moss head?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.38,0:25:05.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.35,0:25:06.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna ruin everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.95,0:25:08.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NFinally made it, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.68,0:25:10.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You get lost or something?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.05,0:25:12.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWhoa whoa whoa whoa, don't you dare!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.96,0:25:15.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't even go there!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.27,0:25:21.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Sniper King!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.78,0:25:28.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhat? He's flying!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.55,0:25:30.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NAwesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.00,0:25:32.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWhere's he been all this time?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.17,0:25:41.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is he supposed to land?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.78,0:25:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.72,0:25:46.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The gang's all here.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.99,0:25:47.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KUMADORI]\NYoyoi!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.95,0:25:51.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quite the show, indeed!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.59,0:25:53.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NSniper King!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.06,0:25:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Although they may be\Nour sworn adversaries.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.60,0:25:59.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To have come this far\Nis truly quite impressive!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.53,0:26:04.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't funny anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:04.64,0:26:06.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just go away!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.40,0:26:28.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NC'mon Robin, work with me here!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.01,0:26:30.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can say what you want.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.12,0:26:33.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wanna die or\Nwhatever, that's fine,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.18,0:26:37.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but when you say it,\Nyou say it as part of our crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.98,0:26:40.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYeah Robin, he's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.45,0:26:42.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back, Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.01,0:27:06.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHey Sniper King, can you stand?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.11,0:27:09.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NHm? Uh yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.55,0:27:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A fall like that won't stop me!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.65,0:27:20.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:05.79,0:28:08.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NFrom now on, leave everything to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.51,0:01:58.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NGear? Your techniques have changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:03.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you supposed to be a steam engine? You\Ncertainly are full of hot air.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:05.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're starting to test my patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.32,0:02:14.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThe truth is I'm glad I met you guys when I\Ndid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.66,0:02:18.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:25.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NWhat, are you stopping to aim? That only gives\Nme more time to dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.84,0:02:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine. Let's see how good your aim is, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.96,0:02:30.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:32.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NJet Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.98,0:02:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.67,0:04:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhen we fought before, and it looked like you\Nwere disappearing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:36.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you were really just moving your feet ten or\Ntwenty times a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.51,0:04:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got the hang of it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:42.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I never would've figured something like\Nthat out on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:45.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:49.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLUENO]\NI can take it. I'll use my strongest defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:53.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body. Strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.86,0:04:56.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NJet Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.77,0:13:12.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NGum-Gum...
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
